# Butler Routes - Ashenvale completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Alliance accept in the local census (55 quests,
# docs/ashenvale-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turnin. The 39 Horde-accept quests stay with the Horde block's census. No
# race header: the data shows no single-race-locked quests here, so per-line
# class gates only (Warrior, Paladin, Human+Dwarf Paladin). Soft-pre accepts
# whose blocking pre-quest sits outside the contract carry a note at the
# accept; their completes and turn-ins stand alone in `when onquest`
# mini-steps. Out-of-zone objectives complete at their data-placed locations
# in expedition legs. Coordinates in Ashenvale use the era frame; expedition
# stops use the frames their data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ashenvale
title Ashenvale - Completionist
levels 18-32
zone Ashenvale
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords ashenvale, completionist
coords live
version 1

step Melyria's watch, north entry

  note In from Darkshore along the north road: Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow holds the vale's watch, and Illiyana's dryads need the east. Quests here run 18 to 32 — the steps say which legs belong to which level.
  accept 1022 only Alliance -- The Howling Vale - Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow; the Tome of Mel'Thandris, central
  accept 1021 only Alliance -- Vile Satyr! Dryads in Danger! - Illiyana; Anilia takes it, far east

